            "text": "{\"page\":1,\"results\":[{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/dUbOGH7CWEIr2aCZBpG2n33Vhw2.jpg\",\"id\":1141182,\"title\":\"Die Alone\",\"original_title\":\"Die Alone\",\"overview\":\"Lost in a world reclaimed by nature and overrun by mysterious creatures, Ethan, a young man with amnesia navigates the dangerous landscape in search of his lost love Emma.  His journey takes an unexpected turn when he encounters Mae, a hardened and eccentric survivor.  Together, Ethan and Mae face threats both human and otherwise before a fateful encounter with Kai unravels a secret that lies just beyond Ethan's fractured memory.\",\"poster_path\":\"/dQdIj2OYELhLzECWONY932wGRxA.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,53,878],\"popularity\":7.2847,\"release_date\":\"2024-09-27\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.364,\"vote_count\":209},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/oOZtWMhJft0QvPcnJXFgGlt0Jn7.jpg\",\"id\":11683,\"title\":\"Land of the Dead\",\"original_title\":\"Land of the Dead\",\"overview\":\"The living dead have taken over the world, and the remaining humans live in a walled city to protect themselves as they cope with the situation.\",\"poster_path\":\"/xxp0qcZ3n2YA53SIzWilDSfIaA4.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,878,53],\"popularity\":9.4096,\"release_date\":\"2005-06-18\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.272,\"vote_count\":1900},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/8J7J7CBmapmcMaxsn9KMiaHzOU2.jpg\",\"id\":1576,\"title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"original_title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"overview\":\"When a virus leaks from a top-secret facility, turning all resident researchers into ravenous zombies and their lab animals into mutated hounds from hell, the government sends in an elite military task force to contain the outbreak.\",\"poster_path\":\"/1UKNef590A0ZaMnxsscIcWuK1Em.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,28,878],\"popularity\":19.8456,\"release_date\":\"2002-03-15\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.682,\"vote_count\":7225},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/5UgYt4ewCZZeX9HEG1Bk0ts4xu7.jpg\",\"id\":7737,\"title\":\"Resident Evil: Extinction\",\"original_title\":\"Resident Evil: Extinction\",\"overview\":\"Years after the Racoon City catastrophe, survivors travel across the Nevada desert, hoping to make it to Alaska. Alice joins the caravan and their fight against hordes of zombies and the evil Umbrella Corp.\",\"poster_path\":\"/6yaLr7Ymg5cvbtSVi5hHwBKx35I.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,28,878],\"popularity\":6.0702,\"release_date\":\"2007-09-20\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.309,\"vote_count\":4772},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/1kQGVh547uKRQwyEsnmYEsVVhiN.jpg\",\"id\":106845,\"title\":\"Re-Kill\",\"original_title\":\"Re-Kill\",\"overview\":\"Five years after a zombie outbreak, the men and women of R-Division hunt down and destroy the undead. When they see signs of a second outbreak, they fear humanity may not survive.\",\"poster_path\":\"/iPunx6eRmwxCDuDGB0N0o1jqADP.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,878],\"popularity\":2.9948,\"release_date\":\"2015-10-16\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.939,\"vote_count\":179},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/5PJP3NaiH9ZJRzrEHLeqSY5rNxb.jpg\",\"id\":1577,\"title\":\"Resident Evil: Apocalypse\",\"original_title\":\"Resident Evil: Apocalypse\",\"overview\":\"As the city is locked down under quarantine, Alice finds out that the people that died from the previous incident at the Umbrella Corporation have turned into zombies. She then joins a small band of elite soldiers, who are enlisted to rescue the missing daughter of the creator of the mutating T-virus.  Once lack of luck and resources happen, they begin to wage an exhilarating battle to survive and escape before the Umbrella Corporation erases its experiment from the face of the earth.\",\"poster_path\":\"/yzNQSLlZb7NAkA4C5uADfNDJ7hm.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,28,878],\"popularity\":11.8769,\"release_date\":\"2004-09-10\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.376,\"vote_count\":4979},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/bXtkVDYcwyg9II0cHk6zhtzZGc3.jpg\",\"id\":338676,\"title\":\"Extinction\",\"original_title\":\"Extinction\",\"overview\":\"And suddenly, overnight, the world came to a halt. Two men, two survivors, one kid, and hatred that separates them. A place forgotten by everyone, including the creatures that inhabit the Earth... until now.\",\"poster_path\":\"/zwIDreu9pYCqKpv4jomqVM9yX1e.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,878,53],\"popularity\":6.0316,\"release_date\":\"2015-08-07\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.4,\"vote_count\":856},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/c1bejD7jTTf8qSUkcv32Gmv8N50.jpg\",\"id\":924,\"title\":\"Dawn of the Dead\",\"original_title\":\"Dawn of the Dead\",\"overview\":\"A group of survivors take refuge in a shopping mall after the world is taken over by aggressive, flesh-eating zombies.\",\"poster_path\":\"/ttquyxStEEctzghtA2f4PUGprDr.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,878,28],\"popularity\":20.2602,\"release_date\":\"2004-03-19\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.091,\"vote_count\":4746},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/kAyNuFjRk1B7HyYwRTPWeDKAc1v.jpg\",\"id\":1320330,\"title\":\"Year 10\",\"original_title\":\"Year 10\",\"overview\":\"After the fall of civilization, the few survivors have been driven to cannibalism. A young man must confront a violent tribe that has murdered his father and stolen the medicine that keeps his girlfriend alive.\",\"poster_path\":\"/zqeFM6cjHjYmgjqJExjt1NPBPdd.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,878],\"popularity\":3.6285,\"release_date\":\"2024-08-24\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.3,\"vote_count\":127},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/4mcOCiR06dqQ5eoEJcG3zvonjOa.jpg\",\"id\":294254,\"title\":\"Maze Runner: The Scorch Trials\",\"original_title\":\"Maze Runner: The Scorch Trials\",\"overview\":\"Thomas and his fellow Gladers face their greatest challenge yet: searching for clues about the mysterious and powerful organization known as WCKD. Their journey takes them to the Scorch, a desolate landscape filled with unimaginable obstacles. Teaming up with resistance fighters, the Gladers take on WCKD’s vastly superior forces and uncover its shocking plans for them all.\",\"poster_path\":\"/mYw7ZyejqSCPFlrT2jHZOESZDU3.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[878,28,53,12],\"popularity\":18.2029,\"release_date\":\"2015-09-09\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.7,\"vote_count\":11284},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/gqrnQA6Xppdl8vIb2eJc58VC1tW.jpg\",\"id\":76341,\"title\":\"Mad Max: Fury Road\",\"original_title\":\"Mad Max: Fury Road\",\"overview\":\"An apocalyptic story set in the furthest reaches of our planet, in a stark desert landscape where humanity is broken, and most everyone is crazed fighting for the necessities of life. Within this world exist two rebels on the run who just might be able to restore order.\",\"poster_path\":\"/ulcAi4dKpAjHwYGS08vNyx9H6I9.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[28,12,878],\"popularity\":57.2333,\"release_date\":\"2015-05-13\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.6,\"vote_count\":24728},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/yDmrli2yAPHa9ZLd7iM4T1EKLDL.jpg\",\"id\":30694,\"title\":\"The Resurrected\",\"original_title\":\"The Resurrected\",\"overview\":\"Charles Dexter Ward, a wealthy scientist, uses an ancient diary and human remains to begin a terrifying and bloody pursuit for immortality.\",\"poster_path\":\"/nhQwgcIDD5XcKWLMLyrgqY4bFZd.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,53,878],\"popularity\":4.2095,\"release_date\":\"1991-10-19\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.2,\"vote_count\":141},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/wYtEvBmpBRXPdwGgr1gcWiwJSI7.jpg\",\"id\":460458,\"title\":\"Resident Evil: Welcome to Raccoon City\",\"original_title\":\"Resident Evil: Welcome to Raccoon City\",\"overview\":\"Once the booming home of pharmaceutical giant Umbrella Corporation, Raccoon City is now a dying Midwestern town. The company’s exodus left the city a wasteland…with great evil brewing below the surface. When that evil is unleashed, the townspeople are forever…changed…and a small group of survivors must work together to uncover the truth behind Umbrella and make it through the night.\",\"poster_path\":\"/bArhvjRHl535XMaSh9VjInF2mSZ.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[28,27,878],\"popularity\":192.6297,\"release_date\":\"2021-11-24\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.947,\"vote_count\":2859},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/hHDNOlATHhre4eZ7aYz5cdyJLik.jpg\",\"id\":1272837,\"title\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"original_title\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"overview\":\"Dr. Kelson finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's encounter with Jimmy Crystal becomes a nightmare he can't escape.\",\"poster_path\":\"/kK1BGkG3KAvWB0WMV1DfOx9yTMZ.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,53,878],\"popularity\":24.6592,\"release_date\":\"2026-01-14\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.1,\"vote_count\":1821},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/Aiwk4Ywd296AkKeVtC2auwFKhyy.jpg\",\"id\":399894,\"title\":\"Daylight's End\",\"original_title\":\"Daylight's End\",\"overview\":\"Years after a mysterious plague has devastated the planet and turned most of humanity into blood-hungry creatures, a rogue drifter on a vengeful hunt stumbles across a band of survivors in an abandoned police station and reluctantly agrees to try to help them defend themselves and escape to the sanctuary they so desperately need.\",\"poster_path\":\"/sNDodM6si97uhiPhf5dTM6n6aDj.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[28,27,878],\"popularity\":5.0049,\"release_date\":\"2016-04-16\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.862,\"vote_count\":221},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/b93N6Mb08NhFhobB8KrR5GBaPP5.jpg\",\"id\":969686,\"title\":\"4 Horsemen: Apocalypse\",\"original_title\":\"4 Horsemen: Apocalypse\",\"overview\":\"A small team of scientists must race against time to stop what seems to be a cascade of global disasters signaling the possible apocalypse and end of days.\",\"poster_path\":\"/dt3mo4tArf2llDiht91cnvUtSgT.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[878,27,10770],\"popularity\":3.8141,\"release_date\":\"2022-04-29\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.883,\"vote_count\":141},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/8SnnGg0cqfa3bmorOERNrXvZ8Mn.jpg\",\"id\":11954,\"title\":\"Lifeforce\",\"original_title\":\"Lifeforce\",\"overview\":\"A race of space vampires arrives in London and infects the populace, commencing an apocalyptic descent into chaos.\",\"poster_path\":\"/AeLmyhJNQd2BMFGER36ctAeDhIp.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,878,28,9648],\"popularity\":9.2805,\"release_date\":\"1985-06-21\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.2,\"vote_count\":784},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/kg2FOT2Oe5PSCgs3L4vLel6B7ck.jpg\",\"id\":72190,\"title\":\"World War Z\",\"original_title\":\"World War Z\",\"overview\":\"Life for former United Nations investigator Gerry Lane and his family seems content. Suddenly, the world is plagued by a mysterious infection turning whole human populations into rampaging mindless zombies. After barely escaping the chaos, Lane is persuaded to go on a mission to investigate this disease. What follows is a perilous trek around the world where Lane must brave horrific dangers and long odds to find answers before human civilization falls.\",\"poster_path\":\"/aCnVdvExw6UWSeQfr0tUH3jr4qG.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[28,27,878],\"popularity\":37.0674,\"release_date\":\"2013-06-19\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.853,\"vote_count\":17136},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/6WqqEjiycNvDLjbEClM1zCwIbDD.jpg\",\"id\":1100988,\"title\":\"28 Years Later\",\"original_title\":\"28 Years Later\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-eight years after the Rage virus outbreak, a heavily-defended island survives connected to the mainland by a single causeway. When one of the group leaves the island into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"poster_path\":\"/n5FygjEppOvac6yEaowi26nTyw3.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,53,878],\"popularity\":34.4611,\"release_date\":\"2025-06-18\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.6,\"vote_count\":3036},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/bWF5ImUscXXYia8owpm8coadR4m.jpg\",\"id\":1257009,\"title\":\"Primitive War\",\"original_title\":\"Primitive War\",\"overview\":\"During the Vietnam War, a recon unit ventures to an isolated jungle valley to uncover the fate of a missing platoon. They soon find themselves in a fight for their lives against an unexpected enemy — prehistoric dinosaurs.\",\"poster_path\":\"/noujgznyJIaurEinZhcSVzTmkLo.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[28,27,10752,878],\"popularity\":11.6855,\"release_date\":\"202